zyW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pororo1567/works/49", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/517eaf05/uploads/origins/4119bf09-6ac7-41a5-bf7c-41dd29142a47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68568ae9ce2e6fba619cb242024e0da2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/517eaf05/uploads/origins/4119bf09-6ac7-41a5-bf7c-41dd29142a47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68568ae9ce2e6fba619cb242024e0da2, https://si.imgix.net/517eaf05/uploads/origins/4119bf09-6ac7-41a5-bf7c-41dd29142a47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82ea742a774427dc7793c3ef9b0a59bc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/517eaf05/uploads/origins/4119bf09-6ac7-41a5-bf7c-41dd29142a47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70ae50e1efb88264d799f1f13f55660f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "駆け込み失礼します😭💖💖‼️\n未定さんが描いた日向が見てみたく…‼️背景や描画範囲はお任せ致します🙇‍♂️‼️よろしくお願いします‼️\n資料\n全体 イラスト\nhttps://x.com/tatami_de_drive/status/1900565853340647609?s=46&t=_9xKHyUAJGtfV0_gj3rYeA\n性格等\nhttps://x.com/tatami_de_drive/status/1900649279745597871?s=46&t=_9xKHyUAJGtfV0_gj3rYeA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pororo1567/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7e0c792a/uploads/origins/f7cca8f4-4d33-43e6-9183-b466796aaac1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1688c5aff398883d82f6b49d1cd841f9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7e0c792a/uploads/origins/f7cca8f4-4d33-43e6-9183-b466796aaac1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1688c5aff398883d82f6b49d1cd841f9, https://si.imgix.net/7e0c792a/uploads/origins/f7cca8f4-4d33-43e6-9183-b466796aaac1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80815e033443f74cbd20b672e4d7d8fb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7e0c792a/uploads/origins/f7cca8f4-4d33-43e6-9183-b466796aaac1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b5660b3472f3f721bd41cd0f77335f5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたの絵が大好きで、私の半分悪魔のクレリック・キャラクターを描いてもらえるととてもうれしいです。彼女は優しくて母性的な人ですが、邪悪な神を崇拝しています。頭のろうそくは妖怪のもので、足はヤギの足です。目は普段は閉じていますが、魔法の炎と同じ色の虹彩を持っています。彼女のポーズはあなたにお任せします、ありがとうございました！リファレンスが見れなくてごめんなさい、今は直ってるはずです :)\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/31180583.mehetabel-hollis#94365869", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pororo1567/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3547beb3/uploads/origins/ca661510-ec5b-4b08-818c-641ace946e9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc2218c81b72efe70c7c38674f0f0b0d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3547beb3/uploads/origins/ca661510-ec5b-4b08-818c-641ace946e9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc2218c81b72efe70c7c38674f0f0b0d, https://si.imgix.net/3547beb3/uploads/origins/ca661510-ec5b-4b08-818c-641ace946e9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b01ec0581529712d28619859f7d9875 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3547beb3/uploads/origins/ca661510-ec5b-4b08-818c-641ace946e9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b519d88d30f8bccf50f088d3748c9bcb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ぽろろさん、アピールありがとうございます！作品を拝見し、ダークな雰囲気に一目惚れしました！\n私のキャラクター「M」をダークな雰囲気で描いていただけたら嬉しいです。影のような魔物が日常生活を邪魔しているため、常に不安で睡眠不足に悩まされています。参考までに、影のような魔物は「night terror」というファイルにあります。\n衣装やアクセサリーはどれを使ってもいいし、自分で自由にアレンジしてもいい。任意ですが、新しい服を着せることもできます。\n\nポーズや構図はお任せします！よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1r0mlodHreGTVi847wcBDfUatrvsC-mI7?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pororo1567/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/de64137a/uploads/origins/878b6aba-5452-4e3c-bbac-eff97a7fdd80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4ec01b19412923a8e975a868a391a57", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de64137a/uploads/origins/878b6aba-5452-4e3c-bbac-eff97a7fdd80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4ec01b19412923a8e975a868a391a57, https://si.imgix.net/de64137a/uploads/origins/878b6aba-5452-4e3c-bbac-eff97a7fdd80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ccc7bc4ce9ff15db82cb96d52f0791b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/de64137a/uploads/origins/878b6aba-5452-4e3c-bbac-eff97a7fdd80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f753d6ce30153edd1165533fb9901035 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello there,\nThank you for the appeal! That is some high praise for who I assume is Sylphia. I would be more than happy for you to draw her however you wish.\nShe's a former underground colosseum, now a carefree wandering mercenary. She's very easy going but combat excites her a lot. She can swing her gigantic greataxe with ease while still being quite agile. If the greataxe is knocked out of her hands, she reverts to her older self, which is more menacing and cold blooded and is an expert in hand to hand combat. The axe acts as a limiter in a sense.\nI look forward to your work!\n\nSylphia: https://photos.app.goo.gl/mftS8tnNgCQt2u7M8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pororo1567/works/45", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/960c18f3/uploads/origins/1d6d17fc-3448-408e-8eeb-e2e3a68d227b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6cf0860f24462886a32ce0043ddcd69", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/960c18f3/uploads/origins/1d6d17fc-3448-408e-8eeb-e2e3a68d227b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6cf0860f24462886a32ce0043ddcd69, https://si.imgix.net/960c18f3/uploads/origins/1d6d17fc-3448-408e-8eeb-e2e3a68d227b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc67f653c531d3f907a39c8daf427934 2x, https://si.imgix.net/960c18f3/uploads/origins/1d6d17fc-3